        answer: "⦿ (a)(i)\n"
            r"Principal, P = ₵1,800,000, Rate, R = 12\frac{1}{2}\% = \frac{25}{2}\%, Time, T = 1 \text{ yr}"
            "\n\n"
            r"\text{Interest, } I = \frac{P \times R \times T}{100} = \frac{1,800,000 \times \frac{25}{2} \times 1}{100}"
