            r"\text{Amount to be paid at the end of the year} = ₵1,800,000 + ₵225,000 = ₵2,025,000.00"
            "\n\n"
            "⦿ (a)(iii)\n"
            r"\text{Monthly installment} = \frac{\text{Amount to be paid}}{12 \text{ months}} = \frac{2,025,000}{12} = ₵168,750"
