            "(BECE 2005 Q4)",
        answer: "⦿ (a)(i)\n"
            r"\text{Interest, } I = \frac{P \times R \times T}{100}"
            "\n\n"
            r"I = \frac{2,000,000 \times 15 \times 2}{100} = ₵600,000.00"
            "\n\n"
            "⦿ (a)(ii)\n"
