            "Percentage of selling price = 100% + 45% = 145%\n\n"
            r"100\% = ₵2,000,000"
            "\n"
            r"\Rightarrow 145\% = \frac{145\%}{100\%} \times ₵2,000,000 = ₵2,900,000.00"
