        answer: r"P = GH₵ 200, T = 3 \text{ yrs}, R = 12\%"
            "\n\n"
            r"\text{Interest, } I = \frac{P \times R \times T}{100} = \frac{200 \times 12 \times 3}{100} = GH₵ 72"
