        answer: "Start with the equation:\n"
            r"3y = 2x^2 - 3x + 7"
            "\n\n"
            "Substitute x = 5 into the expression:\n"
            r"3y = 2(5)^2 - 3(5) + 7"
            "\n\n"
            "Evaluate the exponent first:\n"
            r"3y = 2(25) - 15 + 7"
            "\n\n"
            "Complete the multiplication and simplify the terms from left to right:\n"
