            "\n\n"
            "Factorize the quadratic trinomial:\n"
            r"m^2 - m + 3m - 3 = 0"
            "\n"
            r"m(m - 1) + 3(m - 1) = 0"
            "\n"
            r"(m + 3)(m - 1) = 0"
            "\n\n"
            "Solve for m by setting each factor equal to zero:\n"
            r"m + 3 = 0 \implies m = -3"
