            "⦿ (b) Planets in the Solar System:\n\n"
            "• Mercury\n\n"
            "• Venus\n\n"
            "• Earth\n\n"
            "• Mars\n\n"
            "• Jupiter\n\n"
            "• Saturn\n\n"
            "• Uranus\n\n"
            "• Neptune",
        explanation: "",
