            "(a) State the two classifications of human resource.\n\n"
            "(b) Outline four measures the government can take to ensure efficient use of human resource in Ghana.",
        answer: "⦿ (a) Classifications of human resource:\n\n"
            "• Skilled\n\n"
            "• Unskilled\n\n"
