            "⦿ The soldiers divided his clothing among themselves by casting lots, while onlookers and authorities mocked his claims of divine authority.\n"
            "⦿ Darkness covered the entire land from the sixth hour until the ninth hour, at which point Jesus cried out loudly and surrendered his spirit.\n"
