"Answer: (b)\n"
"⦿ Fear of spiritual retribution or societal penalties deters individuals from engaging in theft, assault, or unlawful actions.\n"
"⦿ Rules prohibiting farming near riverbanks or hunting in sacred groves assist in preserving water sources, forestry, and wildlife.\n"
"⦿ Regulations forbidding improper conduct safeguard public decency, respect toward elders, and sexual purity.\n"
"⦿ Hygiene-focused prohibitions prevent the spread of contagious conditions and maintain clean living conditions.",
