"Question 10: (a) List the four main types of work.\n"
"(b) Explain any four advantages of working hard.\n"
"(BECE 2013 Q7)",
answer: "Correct Answer: (a) Four main types of work:\n"
"⦿ Domestic work: Household chores performed to maintain the home, such as cleaning, cooking, and errand-running.\n"
"⦿ Occupational work: Income-generating employment or trades such as farming, teaching, carpentry, or healthcare.\n"
"⦿ School work: Academic learning duties including assignments, research, and classroom studying.\n"
"⦿ Community service: Voluntary group efforts organized to develop or sanitize local surroundings.\n\n"
"(b) Advantages of working hard:\n"
"⦿ It facilitates the acquisition of essential personal property, shelter, and financial assets.\n"
"⦿ It builds self-reliance and prevents reliance on external aid or charity.\n"
"⦿ It promotes bodily health, physical fitness, and mental alertness.\n"
"⦿ It commands respect, admiration, and high regard from family and community members.",
explanation: "",
),
