"(b) Three main types of work:\n"
"⦿ Domestic work.\n"
"⦿ Occupational work.\n"
"⦿ Community or voluntary work.\n\n"
"(c) Importance of work as a human activity:\n"
"⦿ It provides the necessary income to purchase basic life essentials like food and shelter.\n"
"⦿ It drives national economic growth and enhances public productivity.\n"
"⦿ It helps reduce crime rates and social dependency across communities.\n"
"⦿ It develops personal skills, capabilities, and professional expertise.\n"
"⦿ It fosters a sense of dignity, self-fulfillment, and identity.",
