"Question 14: (a) Describe four forms of leisure activities.\n"
"(b) Outline four benefits that can be derived from leisure activities.\n"
"(BECE 2020 Q8)",
answer: "Correct Answer: (a) Forms of leisure activities:\n"
"⦿ Engaging in sports and games: Participating in physical games such as football, tennis, or swimming for fun.\n"
"⦿ Excursions and sight-seeing: Visiting scenic places, nature parks, or historic monuments for discovery.\n"
"⦿ Learning new skills: Spending free time picking up unique crafts, musical instruments, or languages.\n"
"⦿ Socializing with family and friends: Spending quality moments chatting or hosting gatherings with loved ones.\n\n"
"(b) Benefits derived from leisure activities:\n"
"⦿ They help restore physical energy and alleviate mental exhaustion.\n"
"⦿ They prevent boredom and keep individuals away from social vices.\n"
"⦿ They promote mental alertness and overall emotional balance.\n"
"⦿ They expand general knowledge through exploration and learning.",
