"⦿ Reduces dependency on others: Consistent labor prevents people from relying excessively on relatives or state charity for survival.\n"
"⦿ Promotes physical and mental health: Regular engagement in constructive tasks keeps the human body active and sharp.\n"
"⦿ Attracts divine blessings and respect: Honest labor earns appreciation from society and aligns with moral and spiritual duties.",
