PracticeQuestion(
scenario:
"Question 17: (a) State four benefits of time management to students.\n"
"(b) Highlight four ways in which students misuse their time.\n"
"(BECE 2022 Q8)",
answer: "Correct Answer: (a) Benefits of time management to students:\n"
"⦿ Reduces stress and anxiety: Planning schedules in advance prevents last-minute rush during examination periods.\n"
"⦿ Improves academic performance: Allocating dedicated hours to studying leads to better understanding and test results.\n"
"⦿ Encourages discipline: Sticking to daily timetables builds personal self-control and good habits.\n"
"⦿ Ensures balanced living: Allows sufficient time for both academic studies and necessary personal rest.\n\n"
"(b) Ways students misuse their time:\n"
"⦿ Spending excessive hours watching television or browsing social media unproductively.\n"
"⦿ Engaging in prolonged, non-edifying gossip with friends instead of studying.\n"
"⦿ Procrastinating on academic assignments until the final deadline approaches.\n"
"⦿ Staying up late at night playing video games, leading to tiredness during school hours.",
