            "(BECE 2011 Q1)",
        answer: "Correct Answer: (a) Answer:\n"
            "⦿ Jesus informed his followers that they serve as the salt of the earth, emphasizing that if salt loses its taste, it becomes useless and is thrown out to be walked upon.\n"
