            "⦿ He urged his listeners to let their light shine clearly before others so that people may witness their good deeds and glorify God in heaven.\n\n"
            "Answer: (b)\n"
            "⦿ Moral Preservation: Just as salt prevents decay, believers should exert a positive influence to prevent moral corruption in society.\n"
            "⦿ Guidance and Leadership: Light dispels darkness, meaning individuals must lead by example and guide others toward righteous living.\n"
