            "⦿ He set up educational facilities across conquered territories to ensure widespread literacy and moral instruction.\n\n"
            "Answer: (b)\n"
            "⦿ Justice and Equity: He treated all citizens equally under the law without granting special favors to high-ranking individuals.\n"
