            "⦿ Upon reaching Golgotha, soldiers offered him wine mixed with gall which he refused, after which they crucified him between two convicted criminals.\n"
            "⦿ The soldiers divided his clothing among themselves by casting lots, while onlookers and authorities mocked his claims of divine authority.\n"
            "⦿ Darkness covered the entire land from the sixth hour until the ninth hour, at which point Jesus cried out loudly and surrendered his spirit.\n"
            "⦿ At the moment of his death, the curtain of the temple was torn into two pieces from top to bottom, the earth shook, and a Roman centurion declared that Jesus was truly the Son of God.\n\n"
