      PracticeQuestion(
        scenario: "QUESTION 2 (BECE 2018 Q5)\n\n"
            "Questions 2(a) to 2(c) are based on the abridged and simplified version of Charles Dickens' Oliver Twist.\n\n"
            "CHARLES DICKENS: *Oliver Twist*\n\n"
