      PracticeQuestion(
        scenario: "QUESTION 5 (BECE 2021 Q5)\n\n"
            "Questions 5(a) to 5(c) are based on the abridged and simplified version of Charles Dickens' Oliver Twist.\n\n"
            "CHARLES DICKENS: *Oliver Twist*\n\n"
