            "(j) \"... sleepless sleep\" shows that the speaker is ............",
        answer: "⦿ (a) Answer:\n\n"
            "• This describes Pepe, the young bird with a yellow beak and bright eyes that Debbie and Sandy rescue and care for.\n\n"
            "⦿ (b) Answer:\n\n"
